<HelloFraandsPage title="Rates, payouts & taxes" summary="Har minute ka hissa aur payout ka hisaab samjhein.">
<h2>How the platform share works</h2><p>For each paid minute, the platform keeps ₹2 plus 40% of the amount above ₹2. The platform share includes 18% GST. GST is not added again to that share.</p>
<h2>Example: a ₹20 minute</h2><ul><li>Amount above ₹2: ₹20 − ₹2 = ₹18.</li><li>40% of ₹18 = ₹7.20.</li><li>Platform share: ₹2 + ₹7.20 = ₹9.20, including GST.</li><li>Host share: ₹20 − ₹9.20 = ₹10.80, before any applicable TDS or host tax.</li></ul>
<h2>Weekly UPI payouts</h2><p>Eligible host earnings are paid weekly to your verified UPI account. Keep your payment details correct. A minimum payout amount has not yet been published; it must be published before payouts begin. Check your earnings statement and <a href="/contact">contact support</a> about a missing payment.</p>
<h2>PAN and taxes</h2><p>PAN is required. Applicable TDS is deducted under section 194-O and shown in your statement. TDS is a tax deduction, not an extra platform commission. Hosts are responsible for their own income tax and returns.</p><p>GST registration is generally not required while your turnover stays below the applicable threshold, unless another registration rule applies to you. Your total turnover and circumstances matter. Get independent tax advice if you are unsure.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
